# Where the relay keeps its frames. `StateDirectory=suite-sync` in the unit creates this and makes it
# the only writable path the service has.
#
# The default is loopback only. `--trust-all` admits a frame from any device that can reach
# 127.0.0.1, because the CLI has no device-key verifier yet.
SUITE_SYNC_ARGS=--store /var/lib/suite-sync --trust-all --host 127.0.0.1

# To let other devices on your network reach the mailbox, add the acknowledgement and the address:
#
#   SUITE_SYNC_ARGS=--store /var/lib/suite-sync --trust-all --trust-all-remote --host 0.0.0.0
#
# On `0.0.0.0` that admits every device that can route to this port: any of them can join, write
# frames and membership, and the relay does not verify the role a record claims. Read
# docs/how-to/relay.md first.
